ch Center, 204-3002, 32 Ave Vernon, BC V1T 2L7 Canada"},{"source":"Elsevier Inc.","value":"Department of Physics and Astronomy, University of Lethbridge, Lethbridge, AB T1K 3M4, Canada"},{"source":"Elsevier Inc.","value":"Irving K. Barber School of Arts and Sciences, University of British Columbia, Okanagan Campus, Kelowna, V1V1V7, Canada"}],"full_name_unicode_normalized":"faizal, mir","full_name":"Faizal, Mir","record":{"$ref":"https://inspirehep.net/api/authors/1024854"},"affiliations":[{"curated_relation":true,"record":{"$ref":"https://inspirehep.net/api/institutions/1797539"},"value":"CQRC, Vernon"},{"record":{"$ref":"https://inspirehep.net/api/institutions/906059"},"value":"Lethbridge U."},{"record":{"$ref":"https://inspirehep.net/api/institutions/912020"},"value":"British Columbia U., Okanagan"}],"ids":[{"schema":"INSPIRE BAI","value":"M.Faizal.1"}],"last_name":"Faizal","signature_block":"FASALm","uuid":"b001dd5f-1a02-4f2c-9d28-80b1f9fcc373","first_name":"Mir","recid":1024854}],"imprints":[{"date":"2022-04-07"},{"date":"2022-06"}],"abstracts":[{"source":"Elsevier Inc.","value":"In this paper, we will construct the quantum states of target space coordinates from world-sheet states, using quantum state tomography. To perform quantum state tomography of an open string, we will construct suitable quadrature operators. We do this by first defining the quadrature operators in world-sheet, and then using them to construct the quantum target space quadrature operators for an open string. We will connect the quantum target space to classical geometry using coherent string states. We will be using a novel construction based on a string displacement operator to construct these coherent states. The coherent states of the world-sheet will also be used to construct the coherent states in target space.","abstract_source_suggest":{"input":"Elsevier Inc."}},{"source":"arXiv","value":"In this paper, we will construct the quantum states of target space coordinates from world-sheet states, using quantum state tomography. To perform quantum state tomography of an open string, we will construct suitable quadrature operators. We do this by first defining the quadrature operators in world-sheet, and then using them to construct the quantum target space quadrature operators for an open string. We will connect the quantum target space to classical geometry using coherent string states. We will be using a novel construction based on a string displacement operator to construct these coherent states. The coherent states of the world-sheet will also be used to construct the coherent states in target space.","abstract_source_suggest":{"input":"arXiv"}}],"control_number":1873421,"dois":[{"material":"publication","source":"Elsevier Inc.","value":"10.1016/j.aop.2022.168867"},{"material":"publication","source":"arXiv","value":"10.1016/j.aop.2022.168867"}],"preprint_date":"2021-06-29","arxiv_eprints":[{"categories":["hep-th","quant-ph"],"value":"2106.15644"}],"titles":[{"source":"Elsevier Inc.","title":"Construction of quantum target space from world-sheet states using quantum state tomography"},{"source":"arXiv","title":"Construction of Quantum Target Space from World-Sheet States using Quantum State Tomography"}],"document_type":["article"]},"updated":"2026-02-09T11:55:15.191975+00:00","links":{"bibtex":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/1873421?format=bibtex","latex-eu":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/1873421?format=latex-eu","latex-us":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/1873421?format=latex-us","json":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/1873421?format=json","json-expanded":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/1873421?format=json-expanded","cv":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/1873421?format=cv","citations":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=refersto%3Arecid%3A1873421"},"created":"2021-07-01T03:44:32.676112+00:00"}],"total":1},"links":{"self":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=arxiv%3A2106.15644&size=5&page=1&fiel